{"4415130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Cafe", "steam_appid": 4415130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/ff0ab6b30d84694340a90c5cdca5260c.avif?t=1786550216\" width=1170 height=330 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-of-its-kind experimental title where your voice is the controller. Chat with quirky robots, help solve their problems, and shape the story through real-time conversations. Give advice, make friends, and uncover heartfelt stories in a cozy sci-fi cafe. From the co-creator of Job Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stellar Cafe, a coffee shop at the edge of the galaxy filled with robots who have bizarre ambitions and a lot to say. Pull up a seat, order whatever you can imagine, and meet a rotating cast of unforgettable characters. You might help a robot quit their job, be a guest on their podcast, or help them chase their dreams. No matter what you choose to do, your voice steers the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"Robots facing the camera as if speaking to the viewer.\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice-First Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely around your voice. No menus, no dialogue trees, just real-time conversations and interactions. Speak to the robots, and they speak back. Be creative and expressive, conversations are fully dynamic and driven by your voice. Experience a new brand of humor where your voice drives the comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"A robot turned toward someone outside the frame as it speaks.\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Cast of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every robot has a unique personality, goals, and quirks. Make a friend (or not) and uncover their stories. Each visit brings new robots to meet, new conversations to explore, and new stories to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"Montage of robots glancing toward the camera.\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-First Gameplay</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your real voice to talk, joke, advise, and connect with the robots of Stellar Cafe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with your voice, including menus and movement!</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPCs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say drives the NPCs actions</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Whatever You Can Imagine</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can think it our barista can make it</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-of-its-kind experimental title where your voice is the controller. Chat with quirky robots, help solve their problems, and shape the story through real-time conversations. Give advice, make friends, and uncover heartfelt stories in a cozy sci-fi cafe. From the co-creator of Job Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Stellar Cafe, a coffee shop at the edge of the galaxy filled with robots who have bizarre ambitions and a lot to say. Pull up a seat, order whatever you can imagine, and meet a rotating cast of unforgettable characters. You might help a robot quit their job, be a guest on their podcast, or help them chase their dreams. No matter what you choose to do, your voice steers the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"Robots facing the camera as if speaking to the viewer.\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/eb38163cc018cbd397e545bf20d4fbb6.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Voice-First Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built entirely around your voice. No menus, no dialogue trees, just real-time conversations and interactions. Speak to the robots, and they speak back. Be creative and expressive, conversations are fully dynamic and driven by your voice. Experience a new brand of humor where your voice drives the comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"A robot turned toward someone outside the frame as it speaks.\" width=1170 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/d7bc095e063af98ce858154f532789aa.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colorful Cast of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every robot has a unique personality, goals, and quirks. Make a friend (or not) and uncover their stories. Each visit brings new robots to meet, new conversations to explore, and new stories to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.poster.avif?t=1786550216\" aria-label=\"Montage of robots glancing toward the camera.\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.webm?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4415130/extras/2a3532f090911289250037693a0ebb0f.mp4?t=1786550216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice-First Gameplay</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your real voice to talk, joke, advise, and connect with the robots of Stellar Cafe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with your voice, including menus and movement!</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPCs</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say drives the NPCs actions</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Whatever You Can Imagine</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can think it our barista can make it</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A first of its kind experimental title, where your voice is the controller. Chat with